  old8fe1893 day 43 completions 1; day 44 opens at progress 7, completed False; after one restore: 1 more completion(s)
  new        day 43 completions 1; day 44 opens at progress 0, completed False; after one restore: 0 more completion(s)

2. the check DAILY3 (templates over/fits, cap 11: roll 0, progress 2, roll 0, roll 1) in each combination
  fixed code (c515bb0)                                       same day 2, next day 0 -> DAILY3 ok
  DAILY3 mutation alone (the old comparison)                 same day 2, next day 2 -> DAILY3 FAIL
  DAILY2 and DAILY3 mutations together (set 0 of row 133)    same day 2, next day 0 -> DAILY3 ok
